# JobBeagle — Core Stack Facts

- **Product**: US-market job **decision support** (triage / Interview Strategy) — see `.cursorrules` + `jobbeagle-dual-track.mdc`.
- **Stack**: Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind. (Preserve; do not swap frameworks casually.)
- **Backend**: Supabase (Postgres + Auth Google OAuth + Storage + RLS).
- **AI**: Gemini `@google/genai` — Snapshot `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` (**closed-book, no Search**); Guide `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` (**open-book + Search**, single pass). Models: `constants/models.ts`.
- **Payments**: **Lemon Squeezy only**. Never call Stripe / `lib/stripe.ts`.
- **Extension**: Chrome MV3 under `browser-extension/` (v1.3.0+). Boards: LinkedIn, Indeed, ZipRecruiter, Glassdoor, GovernmentJobs, 104.
- **Domain**: https://www.jobbeagle.com
- **Credits**: Free = 3 lifetime Snapshot (`constants/credits.ts`); Guide starts at 0. Subs: Standard **100 Snapshot + 5 Guide** / Advanced **300 Snapshot + 15 Guide** (`constants/checkout-plans.ts`). Singles: $3 / $9.99.
- **Env secrets**: Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `LEMONSQUEEZY_*` to client. Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` in browser.
- **Docs**: `PRODUCT_OVERVIEW.md`, `ENTERPRISE_ARCHITECTURE.md`, root `.cursorrules`
